<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1443311445"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:11.800"><div begin="37.040" end="1:03.193" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="37.040" end="42.539" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.040" end="37.868">共你有过</span><span begin="37.868" end="38.397">最</span><span begin="38.397" end="38.615">美</span><span begin="38.615" end="39.278">的</span><span begin="39.278" end="39.600">邂</span><span begin="39.600" end="42.539">逅</span></p><p begin="44.400" end="49.024" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.400" end="45.284">共你有过</span><span begin="45.284" end="45.492">一</span><span begin="45.492" end="46.140">些</span><span begin="46.140" end="46.605">风</span><span begin="46.605" end="46.911">雨</span><span begin="46.911" end="47.336">忧</span><span begin="47.336" end="49.024">愁</span></p><p begin="51.797" end="57.420" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.797" end="52.673">共你醉过</span><span begin="52.673" end="53.426">痛过</span><span begin="53.426" end="54.012">的</span><span begin="54.012" end="54.494">最</span><span begin="54.494" end="57.420">后</span></p><p begin="59.110" end="1:03.193" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.110" end="59.990">但我发觉</span><span begin="59.990" end="1:00.325">想</span><span begin="1:00.325" end="1:00.862">你</span><span begin="1:00.862" end="1:01.133">不</span><span begin="1:01.133" end="1:01.623">能</span><span begin="1:01.623" end="1:01.916">没</span><span begin="1:01.916" end="1:03.193">有</span></p></div><div begin="1:06.478" end="1:33.008" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:06.478" end="1:12.266" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.478" end="1:07.510">在你每次</span><span begin="1:07.510" end="1:07.893">抱</span><span begin="1:07.893" end="1:08.126">怨</span><span begin="1:08.126" end="1:08.709">的</span><span begin="1:08.709" end="1:09.162">眼</span><span begin="1:09.162" end="1:12.266">眸</span></p><p begin="1:13.852" end="1:18.637" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.852" end="1:14.964">像我永远</span><span begin="1:14.964" end="1:15.146">不</span><span begin="1:15.146" end="1:15.747">懂</span><span begin="1:15.747" end="1:16.064">给</span><span begin="1:16.064" end="1:16.771">你</span><span begin="1:16.771" end="1:17.149">温</span><span begin="1:17.149" end="1:18.637">柔</span></p><p begin="1:21.226" end="1:25.669" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.226" end="1:22.216">别再诉说</span><span begin="1:22.216" end="1:22.581">我</span><span begin="1:22.581" end="1:22.848">俩</span><span begin="1:22.848" end="1:23.298">早</span><span begin="1:23.298" end="1:23.849">已</span><span begin="1:23.849" end="1:24.215">分</span><span begin="1:24.215" end="1:25.669">手</span></p><p begin="1:28.659" end="1:33.008" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.659" end="1:29.599">像你教我</span><span begin="1:29.599" end="1:29.863">伤</span><span begin="1:29.863" end="1:30.516">心</span><span begin="1:30.516" end="1:30.833">依</span><span begin="1:30.833" end="1:31.382">然</span><span begin="1:31.382" end="1:31.782">未</span><span begin="1:31.782" end="1:33.008">够</span></p></div><div begin="1:34.191" end="1:48.492" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:34.191" end="1:40.859" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.191" end="1:34.932">但你没</span><span begin="1:34.932" end="1:35.371">带</span><span begin="1:35.371" end="1:37.237">走</span> <span begin="1:37.838" end="1:38.152">梦</span><span begin="1:38.152" end="1:38.674">里</span><span begin="1:38.674" end="1:39.076">的</span><span begin="1:39.076" end="1:39.707">所</span><span begin="1:39.707" end="1:40.859">有</span></p><p begin="1:42.065" end="1:48.492" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.065" end="1:42.558">让你</span><span begin="1:42.558" end="1:43.572">走</span> <span begin="1:43.899" end="1:44.392">为何</span><span begin="1:44.392" end="1:44.649">让</span><span begin="1:44.649" end="1:45.077">你</span><span begin="1:45.077" end="1:45.833">看</span><span begin="1:45.833" end="1:46.076">不</span><span begin="1:46.076" end="1:48.492">透</span></p></div><div begin="1:49.048" end="2:03.568" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:49.048" end="1:51.781" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.048" end="1:49.975">但求</span><span begin="1:49.975" end="1:50.776">你未淡忘</span><span begin="1:50.776" end="1:51.781">往日旧情</span></p><p begin="1:51.791" end="1:53.621" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.791" end="1:52.614">我愿默然</span><span begin="1:52.614" end="1:53.621">带着泪流</span></p><p begin="1:53.631" end="1:56.274" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.631" end="1:54.591">很想一生</span><span begin="1:54.591" end="1:55.006">跟</span><span begin="1:55.006" end="1:55.223">你</span><span begin="1:55.223" end="1:56.274">走</span></p><p begin="1:56.284" end="1:59.120" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.284" end="1:57.324">就算</span><span begin="1:57.324" end="1:58.093">天边海角</span><span begin="1:58.093" end="1:59.120">多少改变</span></p><p begin="1:59.130" end="2:00.976" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.130" end="2:00.015">一生只有</span><span begin="2:00.015" end="2:00.976">风中追究</span></p><p begin="2:00.986" end="2:03.568" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.986" end="2:01.895">不想孤单</span><span begin="2:01.895" end="2:02.334">的</span><span begin="2:02.334" end="2:02.640">逗</span><span begin="2:02.640" end="2:03.568">留</span></p></div><div begin="2:03.729" end="2:18.840" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:03.729" end="2:06.561" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.729" end="2:04.661">但求</span><span begin="2:04.661" end="2:05.613">你未淡忘</span><span begin="2:05.613" end="2:06.561">往日旧情</span></p><p begin="2:06.571" end="2:08.456" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.571" end="2:07.419">我愿默然</span><span begin="2:07.419" end="2:08.125">带着泪</span><span begin="2:08.125" end="2:08.456">流</span></p><p begin="2:08.466" end="2:11.062" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.466" end=